@bluebill1049 @miguelSoldado1 

I think the reason of this behavior is from `isEmpty` as fail fast checking from https://github.com/react-hook-form/react-hook-form/blob/master/src/logic/validateField.ts which only allow validate other rules like `pattern`, `maxLength`, `minLength` ... if value is not falsy.

A workaround for this case is to use `resolver` option or `validate` custom rule handler to perform validation instead of built-in validator from react-hook-form.
